    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1114">

                <pb facs="0806" n="690" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg690"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/1865.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Garrett to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Nuevo Laredo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 28, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>A few American refugees have been coming from Mexico and applying for
                    transportation during August and September. I sent out six persons from Tampico
                    district Saturday. Is there fund still available for transportation destitute
                    refugees?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
